            "content": "<p>Keon WiFi with FeelStroker is designed for fully synchronized interactive stimulation. Keon WiFi delivers automatic movements in real time, while the FeelStroker adds a soft tunnel with large stimulating nubs to intensify sensation.</p><p>Keon WiFi can sync with virtual reality, adult videos, webcam interactions, and connected partners. It works with 2D content on over 200 adult sites on FeelMe AI, can connect directly to interactive webcams, and can link with a partner through the FeelConnect app.</p><p>The device is Wi-Fi and Bluetooth enabled for more reliable synchronization and smoother performance in interactive videos, games, and live content. It also features an ergonomic shape, intuitive grip control, customizable settings and plugins, and controllable stroke length with up to 230 strokes per minute.</p><p>The FeelStroker is described as a realistic masturbator with a smooth, body-safe tunnel, large stimulating nubs, and a detailed entry.</p>",
